# Production Deployment

This overlay deploys the services in this repository into the
`__NAMESPACE__` namespace. It is rendered and synced by the cluster's GitOps
controller; nothing in this repository applies it automatically.

## Images

The overlay references the `latest` tag of each published image:

```text
ghcr.io/__GHCR_PATH__/__SERVICE__:latest
```

The images are published by `.github/workflows/build.yml` on every push to
`__DEFAULT_BRANCH__`. They must exist before the overlay is synced. The
`ghcr-pull-secret` image pull secret referenced by the Deployments must exist
in the target namespace.

<!-- BEGIN optional: secrets (remove this section when no service has secrets) -->
## Secrets

Application secrets are delivered by External Secrets Operator from AWS
Systems Manager Parameter Store. Create these parameters as `SecureString`
values before syncing:

```text
__SSM_PREFIX__/__SERVICE__/__SSM_PARAM__
```

Never commit secret values. To add or change an `ExternalSecret`, follow the
`external-secrets-gitops-authoring` skill so the manifest stays fully
declarative.
<!-- END optional: secrets -->

## Rendering locally

```sh
kubectl kustomize infra/k8s/prod
```
